Package: shomer-migrations
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shomer database migrations (Alembic).
 Ships the Alembic revisions and the shomer-migrate runner that applies
 them. Required by any host install of shomer-api, shomer-job or
 shomer-ssr: those packages carry no schema of their own.
 .
 The bundled systemd unit is oneshot and deliberately NOT enabled —
 installing a package must never migrate a database on its own. Run it
 when you mean to: systemctl start shomer-migrations.
